  CardStory: "Protocol be damned, Spades2 thinks. Commanders are far removed from
    the rank and file, but punishment doesn\u2019t scare him. Not anymore.\r\n\r\nA
    jolt of rage surges through Spades2 at the thought of that\u2026 That thing.
    His own identity twisted and bent and burrowing into himself like-\r\n\r\nNo.
    Don\u2019t think about it. Don\u2019t give it a foothold.\r\n\r\nClubs2. Focus
    on her. Her always laughing eyes. Irreverent and cheerful and beautiful and\u2026
    Yes, this is working. Spades2 remembers their evenings drinking tea, their time
    spent training and studying and growing. \r\n\r\nShe takes honey, now.\r\n\r\nHe\u2019s
    so close."
